  "sourceTitle": "Hot Toddy",
  "sourceText": "Hot Toddy\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 ounces Bourbon or whiskey\n1 oz honey, or to taste\n oz lemon juice\nfill hot water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients in a mug or glass; fill with hot water.\n\nAbout\n\n\na warming beverage ideal for calming a sore throat; substitute chamomile tea for the hot water or sugar for the honey.",
